  "label": "Global Diversity Concept",
  "description": "The meme relies on the real-world concept of global diversity, which refers to the variety of cultures, ethnicities, languages, and identities that exist across the world. This concept is foundational to understanding why the image uses a globe surrounded by colorful human figures to represent 'each letter' as awesome — implying that every cultural or individual component contributes uniquely to the global whole. This is a positive, inclusive social value often promoted in education, media, and international relations.",
